WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.469
Welcome to My Cyber Learning.

2
00:00:02.519 --> 00:00:04.000
Here's a quick tour.

3
00:00:04.867 --> 00:00:09.935
My Cyber Learning is a free, vendor-neutral library of the best cyber security

4
00:00:09.985 --> 00:00:14.267
podcasts, books, learning platforms and experts, all in one place.

5
00:00:15.133 --> 00:00:16.702
Not sure where to start?

6
00:00:16.752 --> 00:00:18.051
Switch on MCL Picks.

7
00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:23.515
These are our curator's hand-chosen favourites: the podcasts, books and platforms

8
00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.483
we'd recommend to anyone getting into cyber.

9
00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:32.633
Use the tabs along the top to browse podcasts, books, platforms and experts.

10
00:00:34.233 --> 00:00:36.838
Then narrow things down by topic and level.

11
00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:41.592
Choose threat intelligence and advanced, and you'll find respected shows like

12
00:00:41.642 --> 00:00:44.308
DISCARDED and Future of Threat Intelligence.

13
00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:51.866
Search for anything you like, and sort podcasts by their latest episode to see

14
00:00:51.916 --> 00:00:52.583
what's new.

15
00:00:54.667 --> 00:00:59.594
Each card shows listener ratings, how often new episodes come out, the topics

16
00:00:59.644 --> 00:01:02.050
covered, and links to start listening.

17
00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.442
Community votes are shown separately.

18
00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:08.271
Tap the heart to save your favourites to My List.

19
00:01:08.321 --> 00:01:13.389
Create a free account with a passkey, no password needed, and your list follows you

20
00:01:13.439 --> 00:01:14.375
to every device.

21
00:01:15.233 --> 00:01:20.143
Your list also builds a learning map: everything you've saved, by type, and how

22
00:01:20.193 --> 00:01:22.404
many security topics you've covered.

23
00:01:22.454 --> 00:01:27.364
Topics you haven't explored yet are suggested below, with an MCL Pick for each,

24
00:01:27.414 --> 00:01:28.933
ready to save in one tap.

25
00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:35.193
Every morning, the Daily Briefing sums up the latest cyber security news from the

26
00:01:35.243 --> 00:01:38.408
leading news podcasts, with the top stories first.

27
00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:42.827
Subscribe, and it lands in your inbox at half past eight.

28
00:01:42.877 --> 00:01:47.767
It's the easiest way to start your day up to speed with the latest cyber news.

29
00:01:48.767 --> 00:01:50.263
Spot a broken link?

30
00:01:50.313 --> 00:01:52.867
Tap the red flag to let us know.

31
00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:57.440
And if you know a great resource we're missing, suggest it.

32
00:01:57.490 --> 00:02:01.483
For books, just enter the ISBN and we'll fill in the details for you.

33
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:08.538
This is a cyber security site, so privacy and security are built in.

34
00:02:08.588 --> 00:02:12.410
You sign in with a passkey, so there's no password to steal.

35
00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:17.572
Accounts and email addresses are optional, there are no ads or tracking cookies,

36
00:02:17.622 --> 00:02:22.864
our keys are kept encrypted, and we follow both UK and EU GDPR principles, keeping

37
00:02:22.914 --> 00:02:24.800
only the minimum data we need.

38
00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:30.217
Start exploring today, at mycyberlearning.co.uk.
